  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Looking for a globally‑oriented business school in the vibrant heart of Barcelona? C3S Business School (Castelldefels School of Social Sciences) could be a great choice for you. It’s a fully accredited private business school and offers internationally recognised UK-validated foundation, diploma, bachelor’s, master’s, and DBA programmes, all taught in English.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>C3S has an international community, with over 90% of its students coming from 40+ countries. So you’ll be immersed in a global student body and meet people from all over the world. Plus, you’ll also get personalised attention and a unique learning experience, due to the small class sizes (max 20–25 students per class).</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>C3S does not provide on-campus housing, but its Admissions Office will connect you with trusted local agencies and help secure affordable housing to suit your needs.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Sports</strong><br>You can always stay active, as C3S Business School highly promotes sports and physical activity. They organise various sports events, including football tournaments.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
